note mutant i (0-based): FROM into g_mf, TO into g_mt; false when there is no mutant i
fn gn_msel i ulong to bool
w = ulong 0
s = ulong 0
fs = ulong 0
fl = ulong 0
for j ulong len g_mx bound 1048576
if eq get g_mx j 124
