note the decimal number in b1 after the first byte c of [s, e)
fn gn_tnum s ulong e ulong c ulong to ulong
p = s
while and lt p e ne ulong get g_b1 p c bound 256
p = add p 1
end
p = add p 1
v = ulong 0
while lt p e bound 32
d = ulong get g_b1 p
if or lt d 48 gt d 57
ret v
end
v = add mul v 10 sub d 48
p = add p 1
end
ret v
end
note the ng-use record in b1[0, n): g_n 33 the arena words, 32 the top, 34 the largest group's words, 35 / 36 that
note group's token; false when it is not a record
